reviews.text:
Overall Laptop is Good, Value for Money.
The Main Highlights:
Display 5/5 {💯} 120hz not really but better than 60hz.
Performance 4/5 {Smoothly handles tasks}
Design 4/5 {Tipical Lenovo style body}
Battery Backup 3/5 {Max 3 - 4 hours, Needed charging twice a day}
Built quality 3/5 {Even though it's full metal body yet it lacks the Sturdyness/Rigidity}
No photos uploaded because it's the same you can see in other reviews...
